00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,632
Transition metals show many oxidation states.

2
00:00:03,632 --> 00:00:13,268
The reason: the 4s and 3d orbitals are so close in energy that after the two 4s electrons go, d electrons can follow one at a time.

3
00:00:13,268 --> 00:00:15,690
So the states usually differ by one.

